<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 29-MAY 2.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 29-MAY 2.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>30-May 2. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a</p>
<p>German mark.</p>
<p>	  April 30-May 2    April 29/30</p>
<p> CZK	0.44675	    0.44655</p>
<p> DKK	2.10124	    2.10083</p>
<p> FIM	2.65017	    2.65795</p>
<p> HUF	0.07583	    0.07588</p>
<p> JPY	0.10898	    0.10926</p>
<p> LTL	3.45436	    3.46225</p>
<p> LVL     23.73336	   23.72865</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	     0.00241</p>
<p> SEK	1.76436	    1.7644</p>
<p> UAH	7.59011	    7.62334</p>
<p> USD     13.814	     13.8516</p>
<p> XEU     15.61604	   15.6253</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
